   "source": [
    "### Ejemplo: media movil de orden 1\n",
    "\n",
    "El proceso MA(1) está dado por\n",
    "\n",
    "$$ x_t = w_t + \\theta w_{t-1}.$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Propiedades**:\n",
    "\n",
    "* $E[x_t] = E[w_t] + \\theta E[w_{t-1}] = 0$.\n",
    "* $E[x_t^2] = E[w_t^2] +  2\\theta E[w_tw_{t-1}] + \\theta^2 E[w_{t-1}^2] = (1+\\theta^2)\\sigma^2_w.$\n",
    "* $E[x_t x_{t-1}] = E[(w_t + \\theta w_{t-1})(w_{t-1} + \\theta w_{t-2})] = \\theta \\sigma^2_w.$\n",
    "* $E[x_t x_{t-h}] = 0$ si $h>1$ porque los ruidos que participan no están correlacionados."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "slide"
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "Resumiendo, la función de autocovarianza de un MA(1) tiene la forma:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\gamma(h) = \\left\\{\\begin{array}{ll}(1+\\theta^2)\\sigma_w^2 & h=0\\\\ \\theta\\sigma_w^2 & h=\\pm 1 \\\\ 0 & \\text{en otro caso}\\end{array}\\right.$$\n",
    "\n",
    "La función de autocorrelación es entonces:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\rho(h) = \\left\\{\\begin{array}{ll}1 & h=0\\\\ \\frac{\\theta}{1+\\theta^2} & h=\\pm 1 \\\\ 0 & \\text{en otro caso}\\end{array}\\right.$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "metadata": {
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "slide"
    }
   },
